Hi Avery,

Before the long weekend, a few templates teams are using to close out Q3 and set up Q4:

- Quarterly retro: what worked, what didn't, what we'll change (30 minutes, async-friendly)
- OKR planning board: goals, key results, owners, confidence
- Roadmap on a timeline: drag cards between quarters, export to Jira or Linear
- Customer journey map with sticky-note voting

All four are free on any Miro plan. Open one, invite your team with a link, and you're set.

Browse the collection: https://miro.com/l/q3-wrap-templates

New this month: Miro AI can turn a wall of sticky notes into a summarized doc, and Talktrack lets you record a walkthrough of a board for people who missed the session.

Enjoy the weekend,
